    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hamster &quot;Hipachi&quot; rushes forward and collects &quot;seeds of fireworks&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 3D rush action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; on stage!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the block by rushing through the stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; by defeating enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the stage, let's rush towards the rocket and set off fireworks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fireworks festival will be luxurious with the collected fireworks seeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0A rush action that can be played easily with simple operation and buttons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anyone rushes along the seeds of fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeds can be collected continuously!! It feels so good!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm going to rush where I'm interested... I'll take a little detour...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be rare fireworks seeds hidden that are different from normal fireworks seeds!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get a rare species, fireworks of a special picture will go up in the sky!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's rush well and get the &quot;Seed of Starmine&quot;!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you rush and defeat the enemy or break the block and accumulate the gauge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot;!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rush is powered up and you can enjoy the super pleasant rush even more!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get up to 3 &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot; on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's aim for the &quot;Seed of Star Mine&quot; complete on all stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hamster &quot;Hipachi&quot; rushes forward and collects &quot;seeds of fireworks&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 3D rush action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/8fc8ca3670846d4518cb6ca623967202.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; on stage!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the block by rushing through the stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect a lot of &quot;fireworks seeds&quot; by defeating enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the stage, let's rush towards the rocket and set off fireworks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fireworks festival will be luxurious with the collected fireworks seeds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/aaf20e2db1123f824be42ef9e18143de.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0A rush action that can be played easily with simple operation and buttons!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anyone rushes along the seeds of fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seeds can be collected continuously!! It feels so good!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/34150063cf587a085dffa539a3e8fc0d.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm going to rush where I'm interested... I'll take a little detour...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may be rare fireworks seeds hidden that are different from normal fireworks seeds!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get a rare species, fireworks of a special picture will go up in the sky!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/efaf7111b034e66a7e72e1dc0d39f216.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Let's rush well and get the &quot;Seed of Starmine&quot;!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you rush and defeat the enemy or break the block and accumulate the gauge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot;!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rush is powered up and you can enjoy the super pleasant rush even more!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get up to 3 &quot;Starmine Seeds&quot; on the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's aim for the &quot;Seed of Star Mine&quot; complete on all stages!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.poster.avif?t=1743128300\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.webm?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585330/extras/e44b446767b5f1d5d50a19cff48f6053.mp4?t=1743128300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In order to create a fireworks festival, let's collect fireworks seeds with a rush action! It is a 3D action that feels good to collect seeds by rushing forward with a simple button operation! Rush to blocks, enemies, and many species! Let's find rare seeds and make the fireworks festival a success!",
